Rākṣasa champions sally roaring for Rāvaṇa victory --- Monkey host rushes to paired duels --- Aṅgada wrecks Indrajit chariot --- Sampāti slays Prajaṅgha while Hanumān crushes Jambumālin --- Gaja fells Tapana and Sugrīva kills Praghasa --- Lakṣmaṇa slays Virūpākṣa and Rāma beheads four --- Mainda kills Vajramuṣṭi and Dvivida kills Aśaniprabha --- Nīla beheads Nikumbha charioteer and Suṣeṇa crushes Vidyunmālin --- Field turns charnel as rākṣasas await sunset